      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احتفظ بِهِ</span></b> : see 1. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احتفظهُ لِنَفْسِهِ</span>, (K,)
