    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احتفظ</span> [<i>He conceived,</i> or <i>became affected with,
